  "stimulus": null,
  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The ratio <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> to <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math> is equivalent to the ratio <math alttext=\"9\"><mn>9</mn>\n</math> to <math alttext=\"5\"><mn>5</mn>\n</math>. If the value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"162\"><mn>162</mn>\n</math>, what is the value of <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [],
