  ],
  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"90\"><mn>90</mn>\n</math>. It&rsquo;s given that the ratio of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> to <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math> is equivalent to the ratio <math alttext=\"9\"><mn>9</mn>\n</math> to <math alttext=\"5\"><mn>5</mn>\n</math>. It follows that <math alttext=\"StartFraction x Over y EndFraction equals nine fifths\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>. Multiplying each side of this equation by <math alttext=\"5 y\"><mrow>\n<mn>5</mn>\n<mi>y</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"StartFraction left parenthesis 5 y right parenthesis x Over y EndFraction equals StartFraction 9 left parenthesis 5 y right parenthesis Over 5 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>, or <math alttext=\"5 x equals 9 y\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>y</mi></math>. Dividing each side of this equation by <math alttext=\"9\"><mn>9</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"StartFraction 5 x Over 9 EndFraction equals y\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"162\"><mn>162</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> in this equation yields <math alttext=\"StartFraction 5 left parenthesis 162 right parenthesis Over 9 EndFraction equals y\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mn>162</mn></mfenced></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"StartFraction 810 Over 9 EndFraction equals y\"><mfrac><mn>810</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></math>, or <math alttext=\"90 equals y\"><mn>90</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></math>. Therefore, if the value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"162\"><mn>162</mn>\n</math>, the value of <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"90\"><mn>90</mn>\n</math>.</p>",
